mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">This course, one of the earliest advanced offerings in the Department of Natural Medicines, is designed for doctoral students in pharmacognosy and related disciplines. By surveying the principal methodological advances in traditional Chinese medicines of recent years, it broadens students’ scholarly perspectives and equips them with tools directly transferable to their own research.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
